(7301474, 1138594, 150277, '<td valign="top">Okay, I love this.  Pattern and light, full frame, blue mixed with white, and a bit of movement felt by the varying densities of lights.</td>', 'Okay, I love this.  Pattern and light, full frame, blue mixed with white, and a bit of movement felt by the varying densities of lights.', '2015-01-12 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7301477, 1138611, 150277, '<td valign="top">Weird, and lumpy.  I am puzzled.  Technically seems like a very nice image though with nice detail and black background.  Overall I think it''s quite good.</td>', 'Weird, and lumpy.  I am puzzled.  Technically seems like a very nice image though with nice detail and black background.  Overall I think it''s quite good.', '2015-01-12 17:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7301478, 1138409, 150277, '<td valign="top">I found this image very interesting.  I am longing to know what is the story?  Why is there a room with a big screen and one man?  Image composition works very well for me.</td>', 'I found this image very interesting.  I am longing to know what is the story?  Why is there a room with a big screen and one man?  Image composition works very well for me.', '2015-01-12 17:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
