(7301957, 1138692, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice. Would have scored better in a non-light challenge. There isn''t a definite source of it to my eyes here. Mind you, the same can be said for my entry! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Niall. I suspected the lack of a definite light element was the problem. My fault for using a shoe horn:)</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: Very nice. Would have scored better in a non-light challenge. There isn''t a definite source of it to my eyes here. Mind you, the same can be said for my entry!   Thanks Niall. I suspected the lack of a definite light element was the problem. My fault for using a shoe horn:)', '2015-01-14 04:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
